       ↓
Product Service
       ↓
Product Redis
       ↓
Cache Hit
       ↓
Return Old / Stale Data


## HOW TTL HELPS
----------------

Suppose:

product:101

TTL = 10 minutes


Agar Database update ke baad cache invalidation miss ho jaye,
to stale data TTL expire hone tak Cache me available reh sakta hai.

Lekin:

TTL Expires
      ↓
Cache Entry Expires
      ↓
Next Request
      ↓
Cache Miss
      ↓
Fetch Latest Data from Database
      ↓
Store in Cache
      ↓
Return Fresh Data


## IMPORTANT
------------

TTL stale data ko immediately correct nahi karta.

Lekin agar kisi reason se cache invalidation miss ho jaye,
to TTL ensure karta hai ki stale cache entry indefinitely
Cache me na bani rahe.

TTL expire hone ke baad next request Database se latest data
fetch karke Cache ko update kar deti hai.


